  {
    title: 'Easier collaboration',
    description:
      'same timezone, and willing to get on a plane when it matters. Working with an Australian agency means collaboration happens in real time, not across a 10-hour gap.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Not out-sourced',
    description:
      'your project stays onshore with a team that communicates clearly, works in your timezone, and takes full ownership of the outcome from brief to launch.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Shared context',
    description:
      'an Australian agency understands the local market, local competitors, and how Australian businesses and consumers actually behave. That context shapes better decisions.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Accountability',
    description:
      'when your agency is reachable during Sydney business hours and prepared to show up in person, accountability looks different. We are.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Relationship building',
    description:
      'good digital partnerships take time to build. Being Australian, available, and genuinely invested in your outcomes makes that significantly easier.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Supporting local business',
    description:
      'have a procurement policy that prioritises Australian suppliers? We qualify as a Melbourne-based, Australian-owned agency.'
